30e346827d8f3f03edf4ddd4f4cc28", "created_at": "2016-01-06T17:37:07Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a259319cf6136d67f61ec4274713e7ec58bab490", "message": "removed outdated todo log.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 0dd12d0047bcea215e2d40b684025472372c02d0 [formerly 8578384857009f8046d2f2444108153405e9ed97]\nFormer-commit-id: 9ea12c811fb8117502f1a112fcda3c005d52c8e5", "created_at": "2015-04-09T16:26:05Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "830b6945abac59d41eca2799a2f126fc8ab209a4", "message": "cleaned up UnitPainter\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 24d9a36bdc82ca36e28942bf50094472fdb5f4bb [formerly d49dc13410c916069aded260002d0da12a8256bf]\nFormer-commit-id: a0c222be642e6a0d0f7d28707c18ce6ea8989ecb", "created_at": "2015-04-05T00:43:13Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1776d5d8d7681916a68f0effafcbfffe49636301", "message": "sound system seems to be fixed (i've heard that before). Animations now animate based on real time instead of based on the number of times we've painted to the screen. This should fix the occasional bug where the death animation played twice.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: a39ade79195d7fea56bd956b6f1db17383ecdef6 [formerly a5d8fd08778ebd80c576e3bac5956b776fb41182]\nFormer-commit-id: 30df22cb133e6ae447583c2c41b25f44de146fe2", "created_at": "2015-03-12T00:01:25Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "466cffa920274c85698ce26052c5454f544c04f9", "message": "mobs should now animate based on time instead of on the passage of ticks. (6 fps instead of 1 frame every 10 ticks.) It should look the same, but now the fps the game is running at shouldn't affect the mob's animation.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 4b086060b8bac2ad317d2e24303ff87df4c7ab46 [formerly 6843ac239e04dcc371823134e0005012f219ef8d]\nFormer-commit-id: 62dee46f80570a7736b633c9bb4f2591e5f27dab", "created_at": "2015-03-03T03:52:05Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1bfa3e1da321e1d69660a1b5027e35b3b780e88d", "message": "another go at the sound subsystem. This iteration doesn't require writing the mp3 music out to a wave file, doesn't require the Jave library, doesn't leak threads, and as far as I can tell, doesn't stutter.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: b49ded3ec4c04a29b80f9a490c38b8f6f763a615 [formerly a6610d94fd4f22695786e8dabc6ccd069f846dc9]\nFormer-commit-id: a35c123ac8910a1676907a88ccb09dbb8518d45a", "created_at": "2015-03-02T05:12:08Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "04a80e517e81076ef520dcbb4d02b01dfdacdc07", "message": "fixed bug where restarting the game would prompt you to post your score. added logic to prevent the same sound effect being triggered more than once per tick.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: c79e7d288b8c11351c86a60be6e0d2f5f156fce0 [formerly cfc518c9fcc38e5494becb41c38eb180fc43425d]\nFormer-commit-id: 43f625ec5c3e273fba612deb671b9ea51f7ee7cb", "created_at": "2015-03-01T19:09:12Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ab6844ad94ae6b61d3e8f1921a8d5a5aa490b9b2", "message": "High scores will now carry a timestamp. Also, they will be sorted by all of their fields instead of just wave number. Also, fixed a dumb bug where the leaderboard server would only return scores if there were more than 10 scores already saved.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 6be15c9729c5fd9db5e571f718ae82bf9c8920ba [formerly 1673887365db394ea294a044c0510620527b2e4e]\nFormer-commit-id: 02e9f5878039d9ba205fe5a0a92dc669aaf85361", "created_at": "2015-03-01T15:27:36Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "52b124a615344b81a3831d21da330e8330b681d3", "message": "fixed Restart functionality - previously it wasn't nuking the master list of units.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: e48d3ee4e2b95f24f26630d44087b56b1afcabb1 [formerly da5b26ee1b4130944b549592c189218f7d6c8b0c]\nFormer-commit-id: b6f38b463bb25aeee99373071934f7be8af8c975", "created_at": "2015-02-16T19:01:00Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6dc30e134ae7c1de49168cebf9f7069b9c25657d", "message": "\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: b6ca63ffc238ee56655e551361657ebd1d0ff081 [formerly 96cae0eaa0561038bb4267a9d565c584bf62b893]\nFormer-commit-id: a3c6fbae8f3137518c98a7af379c00458a6dadc0", "created_at": "2015-01-16T02:38:35Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c89f1a1720fe0c790fef98fef9f61cfc0cd14339", "message": "\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 622ef3a24f1ec795a1df3057be7c734f082bde87 [formerly b1a7fb1518a27eaab01708ea499cb42e366991d4]\nFormer-commit-id: d9d9a61dd3b4575fdab631e42e2424436c460b75", "created_at": "2014-12-24T23:04:40Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e1d30d1ac99ce9495134164ec253e51e0b57e7e3", "message": "Mob data is now in data files and data file loading now happens in DataFileLoader. Made more variables 'final'.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 2e514053b808e15113e2f1d58ab330ad89743709 [formerly a8c960fd4a41475c935454180a2260265fb53b66]\nFormer-commit-id: 45c356f51f82854091e7a28d986efc6a4bcae993", "created_at": "2014-12-16T16:12:33Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "2a888c39e8ee2043ac895d0aba366601dd30432c", "message": "experimenting with putting final everywhere\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 3d454ee745a12bbed2bb7304bf804e1fe0d60d7f [formerly 97cc8d83a6ff16c13be562b22274eef6e9d1d5a9]\nFormer-commit-id: 80668583ce916c4288f177e08ad18cbd512204fc", "created_at": "2014-12-13T20:56:39Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cf735667ee00e6f38dd45ca5af365735b2206700", "message": "minor cleanup. Still getting occasional 2-4 seconds freeze-ups...\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: fdcc44736b186463bd5be917cb4eff5def1fcd87 [formerly f168b5b5f3db071377908a0045108fbfc73267be]\nFormer-commit-id: 56dab1802546e7b087d20d99a6518cebb2083e09", "created_at": "2014-12-13T17:28:57Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6e7342c4add5fa0e52cc4e48f5e8fa450ca6acda", "message": "main menu graphics\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 5bd6df5ec0352658b105fdd4dceafe1a1f148cce [formerly 516988c48a6609c2a10b5307146b10e7d28722dc]\nFormer-commit-id: 9dcc147f3ff766718bf665ea0a04b39cae83fc00", "created_at": "2014-12-11T03:48:01Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "530858ecb42b32278d2941e0e12035cde7b6ac0a", "message": "lots of things...\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 1ea6461d3c18a96136b397150eb5b862428cc762 [formerly 8622497b94633b42e653b54d77c5089768547c45]\nFormer-commit-id: d09bba09b723d53758daf18fe34324fbd75e1987", "created_at": "2014-12-01T06:54:36Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d9b0ca9b38b97a9c36eec1ba7db8a9f5af2db148", "message": "moved files around...\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 0f32f23966822a64af86d3e7b50c5302d156c7a4 [formerly 7c1ca2039a8559cf8421fdfbadd78393d2e29f84]\nFormer-commit-id: 656f8f967906a23dcc1349cbd50a448369da97b8", "created_at": "2014-11-28T01:06:33Z", "repo": "towerDefense", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0a96a8056990d38d9f64bfa635c3fdcbe499eb3d", "message": "Rewrote MobTileLoader. Refactored loadBufferedImage() out to the Util class. Renamed BodyPartCollection to Outfit.\n\n\nFormer-commit-id: 270e6820fdd350dcc331228535349da217668f53 [formerly f905c352b9e68a4f1cf37f45b6ba0870fc7111b1]\nFormer-commit-id: e82e9fc1f56b95b0d6df6a8bfaced6556ca59c3f", "crea